  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "旧校舎（廊下）",
    "id": "72",
    "timezone": "11"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「だんだん腹が立ってきたわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「さっきから……。何なのよ、もう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「陳腐な、お化け屋敷みたいになってきたわよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「あきらかに段ボールでつくられた墓石とか、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「延々と『怨めしや〜怨めしや〜』って繰りかえすテープレコーダーとか、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「天井から糸で吊られたコンニャクとか……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「旧校舎そのものが、廃墟っぽくて怖いのに。あからさまに怖がらせよう、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「って意図が透けて見えて逆に萎えるわよ。怖くないどころか、苛々してきたわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「何なのかしらね、これは？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「誰かが旧校舎で肝試しでもして、その仕掛けを片付けずに帰っちゃった……とか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「でもこのコンニャク、ぷにぷにしてる。まだ新鮮だわ、ふむ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「あら何よ、転校生。じっと見て……。コンニャク、食べたいの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「あぁもう、うんざりしてきたわよ。あちこち水没してるせいで、制服びしょびしょだし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「まぁ、もともと雨で濡れてたからいいけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「ドタバタと物音とか声とかはするのに、誰とも合流できないし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「疲れてきちゃったわ、いいかげん引き際かしら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「もうだいぶ暗いし、灯りも点かないから足下が不安だわ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「怪我しないうちにいちど外にでて、教師とか、さいあく警察とかに連絡するべきかしら……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「ひっ、あ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「あぁ、びっくりした。何の音……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「あんた、転校生。あんたの携帯電話よ。着信音、鳴ってるわよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「ぐずぐずしないでよ、ポケットのなかよ。もうっ、あたしが取ってあげる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「よいしょ、……もしもし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『もしもし。って、誰？　どちらさまですか〜？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『これ、転校生くんの番号であってるよね？　何で女の子がでるんだろ、混線してる……？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「あ、すみません。今ちょっと転校生がぐずぐずしてたから、我慢できずに代わりにでました。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「転校生のものは、あたしのものです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『うん。よく言ってる意味がわからないけど』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『えぇっと、わたしは双葉みなづき。あなたは、誰かな？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「二年Ａ組の堀田です。生徒会の、双葉先輩？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『うん。生徒会の双葉の、妹のほう』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『っていうか、邪魔しちゃったかな。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『夏休みに女の子といっしょに、こんな時間に何してるのかな〜？　転校生くんは？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みなづき",
    "text": "『ほほう。やるね、転校生くん。とんだプレイボーイだね』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 2,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さあや",
    "text": "「いや、そういうんじゃないです。ちょっと、かくかくしかじかで……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 15,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
